---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Unusual Seeds is a conservatory campus for thoughtful writing — calm, curious, and grounded."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-14">
    <p class="text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.18em] text-parchment-faint uppercase">
      About
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl">A place for ideas worth growing</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-parchment-muted">
      <p>
        Unusual Seeds is a quiet publication set in the spirit of a blue-hour
        observatory — a mature solarpunk campus where botanical research,
        thoughtful technology, and human curiosity share the same terraces.
      </p>
      <p>
        We write for adults who love science fiction, ecology, travel, and the
        future — without hype, doom, or spectacle. The tone is calm, elegant, and
        grounded: the kind of place you might visit to read, walk the
        conservatories, and leave with one new question.
      </p>
      <p>
        The garden holds five biomes. Seeds are essays and notes — planted over
        time in the archive.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-10">
      <a href="/#garden" class="text-accent hover:text-parchment">Explore the garden</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-parchment-faint/50">·</span>
      <a href="/seeds" class="text-accent hover:text-parchment">Browse seeds</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
